{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_5_015ryu_1_5_015_03",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:65592b1ef6033340c69326e77ecd9f3222edaf5c771a2a43ed3057f566491ef1",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_5_015ryu_1_5_015_03:1_5_015_03:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c391997b55a2964fa0fc166f4cc2e2a84ff43baeb6237ada6e314982654dd101",
      "text": "工作中",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_015ryu_1_5_015_03:1_5_015_03:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b5d3e8fa043af75a87dd4faef01ce8885090903c7489ecb33e70005fc16c71c5",
      "text": "【剧情梗概】",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_015ryu_1_5_015_03:1_5_015_03:cmd-000011:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:33d8451285d4e5f69626e1f5771ddc007ba751ec655f29067561078d2496c78f",
      "text": "工作",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_015ryu_1_5_015_03:1_5_015_03:cmd-000011:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6972b19abede879bb40203dc0183c1c965cf3e5e9d2a9ba9307f28de9cd06d5f",
      "text": "介绍手艺人的工作",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_015ryu_1_5_015_03:1_5_015_03:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9e60de62772fcc480d13334d46dc603948b4f737a9b82cde2108aa572e4acad1",
      "text": "今天要去介绍老字号日料店的手艺人师傅呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_015ryu_1_5_015_03:1_5_015_03:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b85e20f210b6874933f21a60c9f402c408e9abb6bf3d8420931e12dcafa74bc0",
      "text": "是的。是在日料这条道路上精耕了50年的\n手艺高超的匠人呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_015ryu_1_5_015_03:1_5_015_03:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f620bfbe6ae92b5abce53a0b09060d5b813c939eb17ab1146946e94de8e9136c",
      "text": "刚才打照面的时候听说了，\n他年纪跟我爷爷差不多大呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_015ryu_1_5_015_03:1_5_015_03:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6f0be531beceafb4243d0b20780793e669bf9e2c8dd5c552fe110c591385436f",
      "text": "到了现在还在一线工作，\n太令人尊敬了——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_015ryu_1_5_015_03:1_5_015_03:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3326664406a2f90d44b9d684bda5101d198503cdc091200b6c715fecfdb3d6b1",
      "text": "看来会有那种只有潜心制作多年\n才能呈现出的美味呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_015ryu_1_5_015_03:1_5_015_03:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:332bba02322f74d8836bda126f04500a45c3d3fa7dd4b58407587313f60cba6a",
      "text": "就是能感受到历史沉淀的味道吧！\n到底会端出什么样的料理呢，真期待啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_015ryu_1_5_015_03:1_5_015_03:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9c79f2dde017a202d4e96892aeab727c5d1d12b0bf0f5ae0d654fa5786ed4d8e",
      "text": "这次的工作，还要采访手艺人师傅\n一路走来的经历对吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_015ryu_1_5_015_03:1_5_015_03:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:efa63da2cae4e417a823dc5be5a3d9238460e710c1a64d010ffa20c5671b59d4",
      "text": "虽然有点紧张……但他也是人生前辈，\n我想向他请教各种各样的事情！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_015ryu_1_5_015_03:1_5_015_03:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:87e6ab2ae335f4265ca302092bb6a17676d5c28a645bd55e330408f13f206e22",
      "text": "说的也是呢，一定能听到很多大有裨益的故事吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_015ryu_1_5_015_03:1_5_015_03:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0d6f1800b6824b23fbf2c1461a3d0b25beb1ef1eb090cb8b4acdc3900cebb29d",
      "text": "就是说嘛。谢谢你！\n多亏了你，我干劲上来了！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
